00:10:45.600 --> 00:10:48.287
It really is the opportunity
where you get to discover

00:10:48.287 --> 00:10:50.406
who you are, what you want to do.

00:10:50.406 --> 00:10:52.323
Where you passion lies.

00:10:53.747 --> 00:10:56.016
You're supposed to do things, figure out

00:10:56.016 --> 00:10:58.448
uh this doesn't really feel
like where I'm supposed

00:10:58.448 --> 00:11:01.007
to be in my life and then move on.

00:11:01.007 --> 00:11:04.093
Listening to your instincts
is really key in your 20s

00:11:04.093 --> 00:11:07.528
so that you don't mess yourself up.

00:11:07.528 --> 00:11:08.495
Really, truly.

00:11:08.495 --> 00:11:09.984
I did all my awful stuff.

00:11:09.984 --> 00:11:13.814
Including drugs and wrong
men and holding onto bumpers.

00:11:13.814 --> 00:11:15.383
And don't leave me.

00:11:15.383 --> 00:11:18.713
It's about discovering
who you are and not giving

00:11:18.713 --> 00:11:21.296
over your power to someone else

00:11:22.686 --> 00:11:26.853
and believing that anybody
else defines your life.

