00:14:02.096 --> 00:14:04.596
(light music)

00:14:05.964 --> 00:14:08.528
- In this video, of course
yes, you're going to learn

00:14:08.528 --> 00:14:10.310
how to win an argument but
you're also going to learn

00:14:10.310 --> 00:14:12.579
how to get what it is
that you actually want

00:14:12.579 --> 00:14:13.489
from the argument.

00:14:13.489 --> 00:14:15.688
You're going to learn
how to make it so that

00:14:15.688 --> 00:14:18.054
the relationship is strengthened after it

00:14:18.054 --> 00:14:21.573
and not ruined even if you do
wind up getting what you want.

00:14:21.573 --> 00:14:23.136
The first thing is this.

00:14:23.136 --> 00:14:25.010
We want to redefine what winning means.

00:14:25.010 --> 00:14:27.631
Because sadly, to many of
us, what winning an arguemnt

00:14:27.631 --> 00:14:29.515
means is the other guy losing.

00:14:29.515 --> 00:14:31.788
We want them to admit
their opinion in wrong.

00:14:31.788 --> 00:14:33.264
We want the people who are
around who are watching us

00:14:33.264 --> 00:14:35.227
argue to say you have a
really good point, man.

00:14:35.227 --> 00:14:36.461
They're out of their mind.

00:14:36.461 --> 00:14:38.968
But the truth is, say
you're arguing about chores.

00:14:38.968 --> 00:14:40.469
And you want the other
person to do more chores.

00:14:40.469 --> 00:14:42.138
And everybody at the
end says you were right,

00:14:42.138 --> 00:14:44.015
you won, they lost.

00:14:44.015 --> 00:14:46.401
Well guess what, that
doesn't feel very good, one.

00:14:46.401 --> 00:14:49.354
And two, they're still not
doing what you want them to.

00:14:49.354 --> 00:14:51.681
Which is to help out ore around the house.

00:14:51.681 --> 00:14:53.671
So redefine what a win is.

00:14:53.671 --> 00:14:55.775
What is it that you
actually want to change

00:14:55.775 --> 00:14:57.168
from this discussion?

00:14:57.168 --> 00:14:59.728
And that'll shift it from
an argument to a discussion.

00:14:59.728 --> 00:15:01.220
So if you want the person to do chores,

00:15:01.220 --> 00:15:02.430
okay start there.

00:15:02.430 --> 00:15:04.568
If you're in a legal or a
business setting and you want

00:15:04.568 --> 00:15:07.239
more money, more favorable
contract terms, start there.

00:15:07.239 --> 00:15:10.319
Forget sticking it to them
or teaching them a lesson or

00:15:10.319 --> 00:15:12.204
showing how silly they are.

00:15:12.204 --> 00:15:14.939
When those are your
motivators, everybody loses.

00:15:14.939 --> 00:15:16.451
But when you focus on
the things that you want

00:15:16.451 --> 00:15:19.114
you are much more likely
to communicate in a way

00:15:19.114 --> 00:15:20.364
that gets them.

